ion class=\"lower-column\">\n          <div class=\"highlight\">耐候性提升：石墨烯涂层空调</div>\n          <p class=\"lower-copy\">\n            该产品使用长效防腐耐候石墨烯涂层，使铝箔<br>\n            耐中性盐雾时长延长至300%，热扩散系数提<br>\n            升31%，耐候性提升4倍，获得Intertek长效防<br>\n            腐最高等级认定和国际顶刊《Nature》专题<br>\n            报道。\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"evidence-row\">\n            <figure class=\"evidence\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Intertek长效防腐最高等级认证证书\">\n                [证书图片]\n              </div>\n              <figcaption class=\"small-caption\">Intertek长效<br>防腐最高等级认定</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n\n            <figure class=\"evidence wide\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Nature专题报道版面\">\n                [报道图片：《Nature》专题报道]\n              </div>\n              <figcaption class=\"small-caption\">《Nature》专题报道</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"lower-column\">\n          <div class=\"highlight\">智能设计：美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</div>\n          <p class=\"lower-copy\">\n            该产品应用前沿的固态射频微波技术并结合先<br>\n            进的模式识别叠加算法，实现微波精准定向输<br>\n            出，使加热均匀性提升50%。\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"evidence-row right-pair\">\n            <figure class=\"evidence\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱\">\n                [产品图：美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱]\n              </div>\n              <figcaption class=\"small-caption\">美的COLMO射频<br>嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n\n            <figure class=\"evidence\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"科学技术成果鉴定证书\">\n                [证书图片]\n              </div>\n              <figcaption class=\"small-caption\">科学技术成果<br>鉴定证书</figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"page-number\">91</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page right-page\" aria-label=\"第92页\">\n      <header class=\"page-header\">\n        <nav class=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"报告目录\">\n          <span>关于本报告</span>\n          <span>走进美的</span>\n          <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n          <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n          <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n          <span class=\"active\">践行科技尽善</span>\n          <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n          <span>附录</span>\n        </nav>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"section-ribbon\">\n        <div class=\"ribbon-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"line\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>环境属性</h1>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"highlight\">降低污染物排放：美的滚筒系列洗衣机</div>\n\n      <p class=\"body-copy\">\n        该系列产品应用全球首创的超微净泡及蓝氧技术，实现洗涤剂用量减少50%，能够有效降低洗涤剂造成<br>\n        的水足迹<sup>6</sup>。该系列产品已获得中国轻工业联合会科技进步奖、年度艾普兰优秀产品奖、革新产品金选<br>\n        奖、健康洗护之星等众多荣誉。\n      </p>\n\n      <figure class=\"media-card washer-card\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"美的滚筒系列洗衣机产品阵列\">\n          [产品图：美的滚筒系列洗衣机]\n        </div>\n        <figcaption class=\"caption\">美的滚筒系列洗衣机</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <section class=\"right-lower-card\">\n        <div class=\"right-lower-layout\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"highlight\">减少毒害物质产生：美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</div>\n            <p class=\"right-lower-copy\">\n              该系列产品采用可换向直排风道和多重油烟分离<br>\n              净烟设计，实现油烟PM2.5低至32 μg/m³，获<br>\n              得一级净烟认证。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <figure class=\"stove-figure\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"美的缤色系列集成灶SP3及一级净烟认证\">\n              [产品图：美的缤色系列集成灶SP3及一级净烟认证]\n            </div>\n            <figcaption class=\"small-caption\">美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"footnote-rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"footnote\">\n        <sup>6</sup> 根据评估，应用